{"data":{"featured":{"edges":[{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"HARMO: HYBRID AND MULTI-ASPECT REWARD OPTIMIZATION ","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/b8ab6ea44b8a761c21c2a1d3e28c7802/e290a/HARMO.png","srcSet":"/static/b8ab6ea44b8a761c21c2a1d3e28c7802/63855/HARMO.png 175w,\n/static/b8ab6ea44b8a761c21c2a1d3e28c7802/ce7ae/HARMO.png 350w,\n/static/b8ab6ea44b8a761c21c2a1d3e28c7802/e290a/HARMO.png 700w,\n/static/b8ab6ea44b8a761c21c2a1d3e28c7802/aab60/HARMO.png 1400w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/b8ab6ea44b8a761c21c2a1d3e28c7802/ad4b2/HARMO.avif 175w,\n/static/b8ab6ea44b8a761c21c2a1d3e28c7802/e0303/HARMO.avif 350w,\n/static/b8ab6ea44b8a761c21c2a1d3e28c7802/bb74c/HARMO.avif 700w,\n/static/b8ab6ea44b8a761c21c2a1d3e28c7802/53de8/HARMO.avif 1400w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/b8ab6ea44b8a761c21c2a1d3e28c7802/eb8b2/HARMO.webp 175w,\n/static/b8ab6ea44b8a761c21c2a1d3e28c7802/f1df2/HARMO.webp 350w,\n/static/b8ab6ea44b8a761c21c2a1d3e28c7802/76c39/HARMO.webp 700w,\n/static/b8ab6ea44b8a761c21c2a1d3e28c7802/17d30/HARMO.webp 1400w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":354}}},"tech":["Multimodal reasoning","Reinforcement learning","Reward modeling"],"github":"https://github.com/RadhaGulhane13/harmo-rl","external":""},"html":"<p>Is accuracy alone sufficient to guide reinforcement learning? How can we address non-verifiable, out-of-distribution, generalizable task associations along with a verifiable, confidence-aware scorer in policy optimization? We present a hybrid reward modeling framework that combines (i) model-based rewards, and (ii) rule-based rewards derived from domain-specific heuristics with confidence estimates. By moving beyond accuracy, we introduce multi-aspect rewards that stabilize training and further enhance reasoning ability.<br>\n<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2510.05283\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://arxiv.org/pdf/2510.05283</a></p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Inference for High-Res Images with Quantization and Distributed DL","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/97167b46036ca6a5c5e589d30ab094b5/541ca/ddl_infer.png","srcSet":"/static/97167b46036ca6a5c5e589d30ab094b5/e514e/ddl_infer.png 175w,\n/static/97167b46036ca6a5c5e589d30ab094b5/f7672/ddl_infer.png 350w,\n/static/97167b46036ca6a5c5e589d30ab094b5/541ca/ddl_infer.png 700w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/97167b46036ca6a5c5e589d30ab094b5/42ad4/ddl_infer.avif 175w,\n/static/97167b46036ca6a5c5e589d30ab094b5/ceb04/ddl_infer.avif 350w,\n/static/97167b46036ca6a5c5e589d30ab094b5/269aa/ddl_infer.avif 700w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/97167b46036ca6a5c5e589d30ab094b5/3ec7b/ddl_infer.webp 175w,\n/static/97167b46036ca6a5c5e589d30ab094b5/b0ef0/ddl_infer.webp 350w,\n/static/97167b46036ca6a5c5e589d30ab094b5/a9ba2/ddl_infer.webp 700w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":548}}},"tech":["Quantization","Deep Neural Networks","PyTorch","Python","MPI"],"github":"https://github.com/OSU-Nowlab/MPI4DL/","external":""},"html":"<p>InferHiRes facilitates the inference for very high-resolution images using the quantization and Distributed DL techniques. It supports half-precision and integer-only precision, providing a 6x speedup with INT8 quantization compared to FLOAT32 precision, with less than 1% accuracy degradation.<br>\n<a href=\"https://dl.acm.org/doi/10.1145/3626203.3670548\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://dl.acm.org/doi/10.1145/3626203.3670548</a></p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"MPI4DL: Distributed Deep Learning for High Resolution Images","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/90ce20a2709733fd00e557efd54036a9/9f163/5d-parallelism.png","srcSet":"/static/90ce20a2709733fd00e557efd54036a9/ac100/5d-parallelism.png 175w,\n/static/90ce20a2709733fd00e557efd54036a9/9a1d7/5d-parallelism.png 350w,\n/static/90ce20a2709733fd00e557efd54036a9/9f163/5d-parallelism.png 700w,\n/static/90ce20a2709733fd00e557efd54036a9/2d51a/5d-parallelism.png 1400w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/90ce20a2709733fd00e557efd54036a9/e2028/5d-parallelism.avif 175w,\n/static/90ce20a2709733fd00e557efd54036a9/f31c5/5d-parallelism.avif 350w,\n/static/90ce20a2709733fd00e557efd54036a9/a8fe8/5d-parallelism.avif 700w,\n/static/90ce20a2709733fd00e557efd54036a9/b24d4/5d-parallelism.avif 1400w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/90ce20a2709733fd00e557efd54036a9/2e40f/5d-parallelism.webp 175w,\n/static/90ce20a2709733fd00e557efd54036a9/df847/5d-parallelism.webp 350w,\n/static/90ce20a2709733fd00e557efd54036a9/892e8/5d-parallelism.webp 700w,\n/static/90ce20a2709733fd00e557efd54036a9/d10ff/5d-parallelism.webp 1400w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":270}}},"tech":["Deep Neural Networks","PyTorch","Python","MPI"],"github":"https://github.com/OSU-Nowlab/MPI4DL/","external":""},"html":"<p>MPI4DL is a distributed, accelerated, and memory efficient training framework for very high-resolution images that integrates Spatial Parallelism, Bidirectional Parallelism, Layer Parallelism, and Pipeline Parallelism.</p>"}}]}}}